/// @defgroup data data
/// The game's data files: the player's settings and the data tables, read from YAML into core's types. Game data
/// (creatures, abilities, the world map, the names) is hashed and saved against; presentation (the effects' looks and the
/// HUD's layout, the seals' looks, the figures' walk clips, the world map's look) is neither hashed nor ticked on. yaml-cpp
/// stays inside this module; its readers return errors with the line they were found on and never throw.
